mw2coop patch for maps/af_chase_knife_fight_code.gsc (Endgame knife fight; the same script in the
af_chase and ending zones; Modern Warfare 2, 64-bit Steam build). Generated by
tools/gen_knife_patches.py; do not edit by hand. Co-op logic lives in
mw2coop/scripts/maps/_mw2coop_knife.gsc. Outside a co-op campaign session level.mw2coop_lead is
level.player and every change does what the original did.

1. Input: the crawl to the revolver read this PC's mouse buttons (the other lockstep machine
   sees different input); in co-op the lead's usercmd, as the hints show (right +attack, left
   +speed_throw). The knife pull's Use button goes through the same helper (QA can hold it).
@@@ subst hint_crawl_right
return level.player buttonpressed( "mouse2" );
@@@ to
return maps\_mw2coop_knife::crawl_pressed( "right", "mouse2" );
@@@ end
@@@ subst hint_crawl_left
return level.player buttonpressed( "mouse1" );
@@@ to
return maps\_mw2coop_knife::crawl_pressed( "left", "mouse1" );
@@@ end
@@@ subst use_pressed
return level.player UseButtonPressed();
@@@ to
return maps\_mw2coop_knife::use_pressed();
@@@ end
@@@ subst wait_for_player_to_start_pulling_knife
level.player UseButtonPressed()
@@@ to
maps\_mw2coop_knife::use_pressed()
@@@ end

2. Who strikes Shepherd: the nearer player at each check; a melee by either player counts.
@@@ subst wait_for_player_to_melee_shepherd
dist_to_shepherd = Distance( level.player.origin, level.shepherd.origin );
@@@ to
maps\_mw2coop_knife::choose_lead();
		dist_to_shepherd = Distance( level.player.origin, level.shepherd.origin );
@@@ end
@@@ subst track_melee
level.player IsMeleeing()
@@@ to
maps\_mw2coop_knife::any_meleeing()
@@@ end

3. The scene's fades on both screens in co-op.
@@@ subst get_black_overlay
create_client_overlay( "black", 0, level.player )
@@@ to
maps\_mw2coop_knife::black_overlay()
@@@ end

